e('1. **RunPodSandbox.** containerd creates the pod\'s network, IPC and UTS namespaces and its pod-level cgroup. It starts a tiny **pause** container whose only job is to hold those namespaces open by existing.','1. **RunPodSandbox.** In a common containerd/runc Linux setup, a sandbox process holds shared namespaces. The kubelet/runtime coordinate pod cgroups. Pause can also handle signals and reap children when used as namespace init; host namespaces and VM-backed sandboxes differ.','Onlyjobfalseandcgroupactoroversimplification.',[pods])
e('runc creates a fresh mount namespace (an overlayfs root built from the image) and PID namespace,','the runtime creates the requested mount/rootfs and PID isolation,','Storagebackendnotalloverlay/PIDshareoptional.',[pods])
