e('Eviction is graceful-ish: the pod is terminated and can be rescheduled elsewhere.','Hard-pressure eviction uses no termination grace period. A controller may create a replacement pod; the original pod is not moved or rescheduled as the same object. Soft-threshold grace settings differ.','Hardevictionnotgraceful,samepodnotreschedule.',[ev])
e('BestEffort containers go first. Guaranteed containers are nearly last, just ahead of critical system processes.','These adjustments bias victim selection; actual memory use, eligible scope and other factors matter. QoS class alone is not a strict universal kill ordering or a promise that a Guaranteed workload survives.','ActualbadnessnotQoSstrictpriority.',[ev,oq])
